    "description": "# RF-16: Payouts Related List\n\n_Related list of Payouts made to this Referrer._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Columns: Payout ID, Type, Payment Status, Amount, Source Referral, Transaction Code, Proof, Batch\n\n* Proof required only for Redeposit payouts, uploaded after payment, per the prototype's help text.\n\n* Related action: Pay Out Referrals\n\n* Batch-payment action selecting eligible (New/Logged) referrals; requires a transaction code and proof for redeposits.\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript\n\n* Sourced from the prototype only.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-16 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n* Depends on the Payout object existing — no Asana ticket for it yet.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-16 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
